  "body_html": "<h1>History And Subgame</h1>\n<p>The history of a position $p$ is the finite sequence of predecessors from the\norigin to $p$. The subgame $G[p]$ is the extensive game whose origin is $p$ and\nwhose tree is the subtree generated by all successors of $p$, with the inherited\nplayer assignments and terminal payoffs.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Section 6.2.1] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>. History of a position and subgame G[p].</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
